+    "name": "Eugene",
+    "rangeName": "Medium",
+    "flavour": "A heavily modified minigun, this impressive 'vacuum cleaner' is the pride and joy of Brick, an eager heavy-weapons specialist from Reilly's Rangers. Fine-tuned and ready for anything, it is perhaps one of the most lethal and flawlessly tuned killing machines in the Capital Wasteland.",
